2026-07-05 16:39:32.949 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: On a rainy morning, Maya felt agile enough to start her first venture.  
She would dwell on past mistakes, but today she chose to improve.  
Whatever the weather, she kept a steady practice before breakfast.  
Her coach said progress comes from daily practice and an agile mind.  
So she ventured into the old market, curious and eager to improve.  
