2026-07-05 16:46:33.098 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: On a rainy morning, Mira felt agile enough to begin a new venture beyond her quiet town.  
She knew that whatever happened, she would practice patience and improve with every step.  
The road was narrow, yet her agile mind found steady hope in every turn.  
She wanted to venture far enough to dwell where stories felt everlasting.  
At the first village, people shared whatever bread they had, and their kindness felt everlasting.  
Mira decided to practice gratitude, because gratitude helped her improve and stay agile.  
She walked on, certain that every venture becomes brighter when courage can dwell inside.  
Even when the weather changed, she kept her agile pace and repeated her practice.  
By sunset, she felt she could improve any dream, whatever the cost, ever.  
So she returned home, carrying an everlasting calm and a stronger will to venture.
